// $readmemh-style elaboration image for preload_image.ini.
//
// Format: `@<index>` sets the destination word, hex words follow one per line
// and advance it. Both the index and the words are hexadecimal, so @5B is word
// 91. Words are written zero-padded to 8 digits: the loader tells a hex-word
// image apart from a bit-per-line image by finding a token longer than one
// character, so a single-digit word could otherwise make the whole file parse
// as bits.
//
// LC_STATE (word 0x03) is the differential code for PROD, 0xE1.
// STATUS_RPT (word 0x5B) is 0x11.
//
// preload_image.ini deliberately sets different values for the same two fields,
// so a read-back showing these proves the image replaced the parameters rather
// than being merged with them.
@3
000000E1
@5B
00000011
